  "deviations": [
    "The client template is a folder inside the Master Control Base, not a separate base.",
    "TEMPLATE_EXECUTIVE_WORKSPACE_BASE_ID is intentionally blank because cloning this whole base would expose private Master Control tables.",
    "Teable represents email and URL fields as singleLineText fields with showAs=email or showAs=url.",
    "Teable automatically creates reciprocal backlink fields for two-way link relationships, so linked tables contain additional generated fields.",
    "No webhook, Cloudflare Worker, email delivery, or other external workflow was deployed."
  ],
  "apiConstraints": [
    "Do not clone the current base for a client: it contains Executive_Directory, API_Credit_Ledger, provisioning logs, global variables, and master prompts.",
    "A clone-safe production design needs a separate template base or code that copies only the template folder tables.",
    "Cloned tables and fields receive new IDs. Discover them by stable table and field names after provisioning and persist the resulting mapping; do not reuse IDs from this manifest for a cloned base.",
    "For link fields, resolve and write linked record IDs. Avoid title-only matching where primary values may not be unique.",
    "Upload files through Teable attachment upload first, then write the returned attachment token/object to attachment fields.",
    "Send date-time values as ISO 8601 timestamps. Teable stores dates in UTC while these fields display in America/Los_Angeles.",
    "Use typecast-aware record creation for select, multi-select, date, user, and link values, and handle validation errors for unknown choices.",
    "Keep API keys and private secrets in Cloudflare secrets or scoped environment storage, not Global_System_Variables."
  ]
